  "_comment": "Where ZWNJ U+200C / ZWJ U+200D are legitimate (§6.1). emoji_ranges: a ZWJ between two of these joins an emoji sequence. complex_script_range: ZWNJ / ZWJ between two letters or marks (Lo, Mn, Mc, Me) of this range control glyph joining (Hebrew, Arabic, Persian, Indic, Southeast Asian). viramas: a ZWJ right after one of these viramas, itself right after a letter of the same block, selects a half form or (Malayalam) a chillu letter: അവന്‍ = NA + VIRAMA + ZWJ, so it may be followed by whitespace, punctuation, a letter of the same block or the end of the text.",
